   "Take Some Time"

  §d🌛 🌜 🌛 🌜 🌛 🌜 🌛 🌜 🌛 🌜§r

§6Take a day off and recoup lost energy. You may be overwhelmed and feeling the need to withdraw for a while.§r
#- §5Okay... now I understand why Sweetpea kept getting spooked by her cards.

I don't know what else I'm meant to do!?

It's not like I can go ask §8The CEO§r or the §2mad scientist.§r

§5Or YOU the reader...§r
#- §5Wait... YOU! The Reader!
What would you do?

If you knew it was game over, everything you loved gone in a blink of an eye?

What would give you the emotional support you needed... before the end?

Show me dear reader?
